      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm working on my sociology thesis and i'm a bit stuck on the results section. i have a p-value of 0.042 for my main hypothesis test, but my 95% confidence interval for the effect size includes 0. can someone explain how i should interpret this? it feels like they're saying two different things.",
